    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "nadia.conard@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Kalamazoo, Michigan - Stryker Corporation (NYSE:SYK) announced today that preliminary results for the fourth quarter and full year 2016 were:</p>\n<p><b>Preliminary Fourth Quarter Highlights</b></p>\n<p><b>Net sales grew 16.3% to $3.2 billion (16.8% constant currency)</b></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://stryker.gcs-web.com/news-releases/news-release-details/stryker-provides-2016-preliminary-net-sales-results\">Read the full release here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
